    "title": "Who won the USA baseball game last night? USA tops DR to reach WBC Finals",
    "text": "Updated March 16, 2026, 8:11 a.m. ETTeam USA is now only one win away from a world championship.Thanks to two clutch home runs, solid defensive and some great pitching, USA beat the Dominican Republic, 2-1, in a thrilling 2026 World Baseball Classic semifinal game Sunday night.All three runs in the game came off solo home runs with Baltimore Orioles infielder Gunnar Henderson and Boston Red Sox outfielder Roman Anthony each hitting one in the fourth to give USA the lead.The Dominican Republic got on the scoreboard first with a solo home run by Tampa Bay Ray third baseman Junior Caminero.The United States defeated the Dominican Republic, 2-1, in a thrilling 2026 World Baseball Classic semifinal game Sunday night.The US also showed off the leather with New York Yankees outfielder Aaron Judge robbing Seattle Mariners center fielder Julio Rodriguez of a homer in the fifth and Kansas City Royals shortstop Bobby Witt Jr. stealing a hit from San Diego Padres third baseman Manny Machado.USA relievers David Bednar and Mason Miller shut the door with the Padre closer receiving a generous third-strike call to end the game.Who does Team USA play in World Baseball Classic final?The United States plays the winner of Monday night's semifinal game between Italy and Venezuela in the 2026 World Baseball Classic final. Team USA lost to Italy, 8-6, in pool play.When is the 2026 World Baseball Classic final?Date: Tuesday, March 17Time: 8 p.m.What channel is 2026 World Baseball Classic final?TV channel: FOXWhere to watch WBC 2026The World Baseball Classic will air in the United States on FOX, FS1, FS2, the FOX Sports App, FOX One and Tubi. Stream 2026 World Baseball Classic live on FuboWorld Baseball Classic 2026 scheduleSemifinals (Miami)March 15 (8 p.m. ET): USA 2-Dominican Republic 1March 16 (8 p.m. ET): Italy vs. VenezuelaWorld Baseball Classic Final (Miami)March 17 (8 p.m. ET): USA vs. Italy/VenezuelaWorld Baseball Classic 2026 resultsHere is how team USA has reached the final in the 2026 World Baseball Classic:Pool B: USA 15, Brazil 5Pool B: USA 9, Great Britain 1Pool B: USA 5, Mexico 3Pool B: Italy 8, USA 6Quarterfinals: USA 5, Canada 3Semifinals: USA 2, Dominican Republic 1Final: USA vs. Venezuela/Italy, Tuesday, March 17USA World Baseball Classic rosterTeam USA WBC roster 2026CatchersCal Raleigh – MarinersWill Smith – DodgersInfieldersAlex Bregman (3B) – Red SoxErnie Clement (UTIL) – Blue JaysPaul Goldschmidt (1B) – YankeesBryce Harper (1B) – PhilliesGunnar Henderson (SS) – OriolesBrice Turang (2B) – BrewersBobby Witt Jr. (SS) – RoyalsOutfielders / DHRoman Anthony – Red Sox (replacement for Corbin Carroll)Byron Buxton – TwinsPete Crow-Armstrong – CubsAaron Judge – YankeesKyle Schwarber – PhilliesPitchersDavid Bednar – YankeesMatthew Boyd – CubsGarrett Cleavinger – RaysClay Holmes – MetsGriffin Jax – RaysBrad Keller – PhilliesClayton Kershaw – Retired/DodgersNolan McLean – MetsMason Miller – PadresJoe Ryan – TwinsPaul Skenes – PiratesTarik Skubal – TigersGabe Speier – MarinersMichael Wacha – RoyalsLogan Webb – GiantsGarrett Whitlock – Red Sox",
